{
  "book": "2nephi",
  "bookName": "2 Nephi",
  "chapter": 2,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 553.386,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.508,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, Jacob, I speak unto you:",
      "verse": "2:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 2.688,
      "end": 7.146,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thou art my firstborn in the days of my tribulation in the wilderness.",
      "verse": "2:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 7.326,
      "end": 9.276,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, in thy childhood",
      "verse": "2:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 9.456,
      "end": 14.704,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thou hast suffered afflictions and much sorrow, because of the rudeness of thy brethren.",
      "verse": "2:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 15.384,
      "end": 18.356,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, Jacob, my firstborn in the wilderness,",
      "verse": "2:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 18.536,
      "end": 20.812,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thou knowest the greatness of God;",
      "verse": "2:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 20.992,
      "end": 24.243,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he shall consecrate thine afflictions for thy gain.",
      "verse": "2:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 24.923,
      "end": 27.338,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, thy soul shall be blessed,",
      "verse": "2:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 27.518,
      "end": 30.722,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thou shalt dwell safely with thy brother, Nephi;",
      "verse": "2:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 30.902,
      "end": 34.199,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thy days shall be spent in the service of thy God.",
      "verse": "2:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 34.379,
      "end": 40.741,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, I know that thou art redeemed, because of the righteousness of thy Redeemer;",
      "verse": "2:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 40.921,
      "end": 44.404,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thou hast beheld that in the fulness of time",
      "verse": "2:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 44.584,
      "end": 47.045,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he cometh to bring salvation unto men.",
      "verse": "2:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 47.725,
      "end": 50.558,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thou hast beheld in thy youth his glory;",
      "verse": "2:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 50.738,
      "end": 55.846,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, thou art blessed even as they unto whom he shall minister in the flesh;",
      "verse": "2:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 56.026,
      "end": 59.788,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the Spirit is the same, yesterday, today, and forever.",
      "verse": "2:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 59.968,
      "end": 62.847,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the way is prepared from the fall of man,",
      "verse": "2:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 63.027,
      "end": 64.699,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and salvation is free.",
      "verse": "2:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 65.379,
      "end": 69.28,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And men are instructed sufficiently that they know good from evil.",
      "verse": "2:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 69.46,
      "end": 71.596,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the law is given unto men.",
      "verse": "2:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 71.776,
      "end": 76.234,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And by the law no flesh is justified; or, by the law men are cut off.",
      "verse": "2:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 76.414,
      "end": 79.061,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, by the temporal law they were cut off;",
      "verse": "2:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 79.241,
      "end": 83.931,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also, by the spiritual law they perish from that which is good,",
      "verse": "2:5",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 84.111,
      "end": 86.108,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and become miserable forever.",
      "verse": "2:5",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 86.788,
      "end": 91.339,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, redemption cometh in and through the Holy Messiah;",
      "verse": "2:6",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 91.519,
      "end": 93.841,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he is full of grace and truth.",
      "verse": "2:6",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 94.521,
      "end": 97.772,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, he offereth himself a sacrifice for sin,",
      "verse": "2:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 97.952,
      "end": 99.949,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to answer the ends of the law,",
      "verse": "2:7",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 100.129,
      "end": 102.869,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unto all those who have a broken heart",
      "verse": "2:7",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 103.049,
      "end": 104.767,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and a contrite spirit;",
      "verse": "2:7",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 104.947,
      "end": 108.244,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and unto none else can the ends of the law be answered.",
      "verse": "2:7",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 108.924,
      "end": 111.06,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, how great the importance",
      "verse": "2:8",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 111.24,
      "end": 114.769,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to make these things known unto the inhabitants of the earth,",
      "verse": "2:8",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 114.949,
      "end": 117.596,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may know that there is no flesh",
      "verse": "2:8",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 117.776,
      "end": 120.47,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that can dwell in the presence of God,",
      "verse": "2:8",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 120.65,
      "end": 125.48,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it be through the merits, and mercy, and grace of the Holy Messiah,",
      "verse": "2:8",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 125.66,
      "end": 128.771,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who layeth down his life according to the flesh,",
      "verse": "2:8",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 128.951,
      "end": 132.248,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and taketh it again by the power of the Spirit,",
      "verse": "2:8",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 132.428,
      "end": 135.818,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he may bring to pass the resurrection of the dead,",
      "verse": "2:8",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 135.998,
      "end": 138.134,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "being the first that should rise.",
      "verse": "2:8",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 138.814,
      "end": 142.018,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, he is the firstfruits unto God,",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 142.198,
      "end": 146.796,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "inasmuch as he shall make intercession for all the children of men;",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 146.976,
      "end": 149.484,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they that believe in him shall be saved.",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 150.164,
      "end": 152.625,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And because of the intercession for all,",
      "verse": "2:10",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 152.805,
      "end": 154.663,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "all men come unto God;",
      "verse": "2:10",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 154.843,
      "end": 157.397,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, they stand in the presence of him,",
      "verse": "2:10",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 157.577,
      "end": 162.36,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to be judged of him according to the truth and holiness which is in him.",
      "verse": "2:10",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 162.54,
      "end": 167.416,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, the ends of the law which the Holy One hath given,",
      "verse": "2:10",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 167.596,
      "end": 170.847,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unto the inflicting of the punishment which is affixed,",
      "verse": "2:10",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 171.027,
      "end": 173.488,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which punishment that is affixed",
      "verse": "2:10",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 173.668,
      "end": 177.476,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "is in opposition to that of the happiness which is affixed,",
      "verse": "2:10",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 177.656,
      "end": 179.792,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to answer the ends of the atonement\u2014",
      "verse": "2:10",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 180.472,
      "end": 181.958,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For it must needs be,",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 182.138,
      "end": 184.692,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that there is an opposition in all things.",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 184.872,
      "end": 185.987,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "If not so,",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 186.167,
      "end": 188.396,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "my firstborn in the wilderness,",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 188.576,
      "end": 191.13,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "righteousness could not be brought to pass,",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 191.31,
      "end": 192.796,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither wickedness,",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 192.976,
      "end": 195.112,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither holiness nor misery,",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 195.292,
      "end": 196.825,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither good nor bad.",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 197.005,
      "end": 200.627,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, all things must needs be a compound in one;",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 200.807,
      "end": 203.083,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, if it should be one body",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 203.263,
      "end": 205.817,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it must needs remain as dead,",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 205.997,
      "end": 208.226,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having no life neither death,",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 208.406,
      "end": 210.542,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nor corruption nor incorruption,",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 210.722,
      "end": 212.394,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "happiness nor misery,",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 212.574,
      "end": 214.896,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither sense nor insensibility.",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 215.576,
      "end": 220.406,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, it must needs have been created for a thing of naught;",
      "verse": "2:12",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 220.586,
      "end": 224.673,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore there would have been no purpose in the end of its creation.",
      "verse": "2:12",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 224.853,
      "end": 228.754,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, this thing must needs destroy the wisdom of God",
      "verse": "2:12",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 228.934,
      "end": 230.745,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his eternal purposes,",
      "verse": "2:12",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 230.925,
      "end": 234.269,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also the power, and the mercy, and the justice of God.",
      "verse": "2:12",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 234.949,
      "end": 237.178,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And if ye shall say there is no law,",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 237.358,
      "end": 239.68,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall also say there is no sin.",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 239.86,
      "end": 242.043,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "If ye shall say there is no sin,",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 242.223,
      "end": 244.684,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall also say there is no righteousness.",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 244.864,
      "end": 246.907,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And if there be no righteousness",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 247.087,
      "end": 248.573,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there be no happiness.",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 248.753,
      "end": 251.818,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And if there be no righteousness nor happiness",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 251.998,
      "end": 254.599,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there be no punishment nor misery.",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 254.779,
      "end": 256.729,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And if these things are not",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 256.909,
      "end": 258.349,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there is no God.",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 258.529,
      "end": 260.154,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And if there is no God",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 260.334,
      "end": 261.634,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we are not,",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 261.814,
      "end": 263.254,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither the earth;",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 263.434,
      "end": 266.267,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for there could have been no creation of things,",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 266.447,
      "end": 269.048,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither to act nor to be acted upon;",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 269.228,
      "end": 272.061,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, all things must have vanished away.",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 272.741,
      "end": 274.134,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my sons,",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 274.314,
      "end": 278.029,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I speak unto you these things for your profit and learning;",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 278.209,
      "end": 279.742,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for there is a God,",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 279.922,
      "end": 281.872,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he hath created all things,",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 282.052,
      "end": 284.513,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both the heavens and the earth,",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 284.693,
      "end": 286.69,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all things that in them are,",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 286.87,
      "end": 290.167,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both things to act and things to be acted upon.",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 290.847,
      "end": 294.376,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And to bring about his eternal purposes in the end of man,",
      "verse": "2:15",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 294.556,
      "end": 297.203,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after he had created our first parents,",
      "verse": "2:15",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 297.383,
      "end": 299.659,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the beasts of the field",
      "verse": "2:15",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 299.839,
      "end": 301.464,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the fowls of the air,",
      "verse": "2:15",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 301.644,
      "end": 304.43,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in fine, all things which are created,",
      "verse": "2:15",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 304.61,
      "end": 307.814,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it must needs be that there was an opposition;",
      "verse": "2:15",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 307.994,
      "end": 311.616,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even the forbidden fruit in opposition to the tree of life;",
      "verse": "2:15",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 311.796,
      "end": 314.164,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the one being sweet and the other bitter.",
      "verse": "2:15",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 314.844,
      "end": 319.163,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, the Lord God gave unto man that he should act for himself.",
      "verse": "2:16",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 319.343,
      "end": 321.804,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, man could not act for himself",
      "verse": "2:16",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 321.984,
      "end": 325.792,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it should be that he was enticed by the one or the other.",
      "verse": "2:16",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 326.472,
      "end": 329.583,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I, Lehi, according to the things which I have read,",
      "verse": "2:17",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 329.763,
      "end": 333.943,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "must needs suppose that an angel of God, according to that which is written,",
      "verse": "2:17",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 334.123,
      "end": 335.795,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "had fallen from heaven;",
      "verse": "2:17",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 335.975,
      "end": 338.529,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, he became a devil,",
      "verse": "2:17",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 338.709,
      "end": 341.588,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having sought that which was evil before God.",
      "verse": "2:17",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 342.268,
      "end": 344.683,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And because he had fallen from heaven,",
      "verse": "2:18",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 344.863,
      "end": 347.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and had become miserable forever,",
      "verse": "2:18",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 347.597,
      "end": 350.291,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he sought also the misery of all mankind.",
      "verse": "2:18",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 350.471,
      "end": 352.514,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, he said unto Eve,",
      "verse": "2:18",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 352.694,
      "end": 357.106,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even that old serpent, who is the devil, who is the father of all lies,",
      "verse": "2:18",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 357.286,
      "end": 358.865,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore he said:",
      "verse": "2:18",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 359.045,
      "end": 361.878,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Partake of the forbidden fruit, and ye shall not die,",
      "verse": "2:18",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 362.058,
      "end": 363.823,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but ye shall be as God,",
      "verse": "2:18",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 364.003,
      "end": 365.582,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "knowing good and evil.",
      "verse": "2:18",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 366.262,
      "end": 369.606,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after Adam and Eve had partaken of the forbidden fruit",
      "verse": "2:19",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 369.786,
      "end": 372.387,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were driven out of the garden of Eden,",
      "verse": "2:19",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 372.567,
      "end": 373.96,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to till the earth.",
      "verse": "2:19",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 374.64,
      "end": 377.101,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they have brought forth children;",
      "verse": "2:20",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 377.281,
      "end": 379.835,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even the family of all the earth.",
      "verse": "2:20",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 380.515,
      "end": 385.159,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the days of the children of men were prolonged, according to the will of God,",
      "verse": "2:21",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 385.339,
      "end": 388.125,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might repent while in the flesh;",
      "verse": "2:21",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 388.305,
      "end": 392.02,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, their state became a state of probation,",
      "verse": "2:21",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 392.2,
      "end": 398.562,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their time was lengthened, according to the commandments which the Lord God gave unto the children of men.",
      "verse": "2:21",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 398.742,
      "end": 401.9,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For he gave commandment that all men must repent;",
      "verse": "2:21",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 402.08,
      "end": 409.557,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he showed unto all men that they were lost, because of the transgression of their parents.",
      "verse": "2:21",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 410.237,
      "end": 413.348,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, behold, if Adam had not transgressed",
      "verse": "2:22",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 413.528,
      "end": 415.293,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he would not have fallen,",
      "verse": "2:22",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 415.473,
      "end": 418.445,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but he would have remained in the garden of Eden.",
      "verse": "2:22",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 418.625,
      "end": 421.179,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And all things which were created",
      "verse": "2:22",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 421.359,
      "end": 423.867,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "must have remained in the same state",
      "verse": "2:22",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 424.047,
      "end": 427.066,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in which they were after they were created;",
      "verse": "2:22",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 427.246,
      "end": 430.357,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they must have remained forever, and had no end.",
      "verse": "2:22",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 431.037,
      "end": 433.22,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they would have had no children;",
      "verse": "2:23",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 433.4,
      "end": 436.837,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore they would have remained in a state of innocence,",
      "verse": "2:23",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 437.017,
      "end": 439.432,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having no joy, for they knew no misery;",
      "verse": "2:23",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 439.612,
      "end": 441.934,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "doing no good, for they knew no sin.",
      "verse": "2:23",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 442.614,
      "end": 447.676,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, all things have been done in the wisdom of him who knoweth all things.",
      "verse": "2:24",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 448.356,
      "end": 450.539,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Adam fell that men might be;",
      "verse": "2:25",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 450.719,
      "end": 452.159,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and men are,",
      "verse": "2:25",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 452.339,
      "end": 453.918,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might have joy.",
      "verse": "2:25",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 454.598,
      "end": 457.802,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Messiah cometh in the fulness of time,",
      "verse": "2:26",
      "lineIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "start": 457.982,
      "end": 461.186,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he may redeem the children of men from the fall.",
      "verse": "2:26",
      "lineIndex": 156
    },
    {
      "start": 461.366,
      "end": 464.385,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And because that they are redeemed from the fall",
      "verse": "2:26",
      "lineIndex": 157
    },
    {
      "start": 464.565,
      "end": 467.212,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they have become free forever,",
      "verse": "2:26",
      "lineIndex": 158
    },
    {
      "start": 467.392,
      "end": 468.971,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "knowing good from evil;",
      "verse": "2:26",
      "lineIndex": 159
    },
    {
      "start": 469.151,
      "end": 472.495,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to act for themselves and not to be acted upon,",
      "verse": "2:26",
      "lineIndex": 160
    },
    {
      "start": 472.675,
      "end": 479.966,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it be by the punishment of the law at the great and last day, according to the commandments which God hath given.",
      "verse": "2:26",
      "lineIndex": 161
    },
    {
      "start": 480.646,
      "end": 483.34,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, men are free according to the flesh;",
      "verse": "2:27",
      "lineIndex": 163
    },
    {
      "start": 483.52,
      "end": 487.003,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all things are given them which are expedient unto man.",
      "verse": "2:27",
      "lineIndex": 164
    },
    {
      "start": 487.183,
      "end": 494.195,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they are free to choose liberty and eternal life, through the great Mediator of all men,",
      "verse": "2:27",
      "lineIndex": 165
    },
    {
      "start": 494.375,
      "end": 499.716,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or to choose captivity and death, according to the captivity and power of the devil;",
      "verse": "2:27",
      "lineIndex": 166
    },
    {
      "start": 499.896,
      "end": 504.215,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he seeketh that all men might be miserable like unto himself.",
      "verse": "2:27",
      "lineIndex": 167
    },
    {
      "start": 504.895,
      "end": 506.288,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my sons,",
      "verse": "2:28",
      "lineIndex": 168
    },
    {
      "start": 506.468,
      "end": 509.905,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I would that ye should look to the great Mediator,",
      "verse": "2:28",
      "lineIndex": 169
    },
    {
      "start": 510.085,
      "end": 512.361,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and hearken unto his great commandments;",
      "verse": "2:28",
      "lineIndex": 170
    },
    {
      "start": 512.541,
      "end": 514.817,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and be faithful unto his words,",
      "verse": "2:28",
      "lineIndex": 171
    },
    {
      "start": 514.997,
      "end": 518.852,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and choose eternal life, according to the will of his Holy Spirit;",
      "verse": "2:28",
      "lineIndex": 172
    },
    {
      "start": 519.532,
      "end": 526.08,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And not choose eternal death, according to the will of the flesh and the evil which is therein,",
      "verse": "2:29",
      "lineIndex": 173
    },
    {
      "start": 526.26,
      "end": 529.836,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which giveth the spirit of the devil power to captivate,",
      "verse": "2:29",
      "lineIndex": 174
    },
    {
      "start": 530.016,
      "end": 531.966,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to bring you down to hell,",
      "verse": "2:29",
      "lineIndex": 175
    },
    {
      "start": 532.146,
      "end": 535.072,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he may reign over you in his own kingdom.",
      "verse": "2:29",
      "lineIndex": 176
    },
    {
      "start": 535.752,
      "end": 541.278,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I have spoken these few words unto you all, my sons, in the last days of my probation;",
      "verse": "2:30",
      "lineIndex": 177
    },
    {
      "start": 541.458,
      "end": 546.566,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I have chosen the good part, according to the words of the prophet.",
      "verse": "2:30",
      "lineIndex": 178
    },
    {
      "start": 546.746,
      "end": 548.557,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I have none other object",
      "verse": "2:30",
      "lineIndex": 179
    },
    {
      "start": 548.737,
      "end": 551.709,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it be the everlasting welfare of your souls.",
      "verse": "2:30",
      "lineIndex": 180
    },
    {
      "start": 551.889,
      "end": 552.725,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Amen.",
      "verse": "2:30",
      "lineIndex": 181
    }
  ]
}